1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,180
or high intensity interval training.

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,820
I'll give that seven out of 10.

3
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:05,680
It's a wonderful mode of exercise, good for the heart,

4
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:07,120
good for cardiovascular conditioning.

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:10,240
However, there's a very strong point of concern

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,780
for patients who have caught underlying

7
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:12,700
cardiovascular diseases.

8
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:14,800
So it has to be done under the supervision

9
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:15,940
of an expert cardiologist.

10
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:19,440
Or in order to avoid the higher incidence

11
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:21,900
of mortality or mobility, it should be better

12
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,960
awarded to patients who have got cardiovascular diseases.

13
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,840
But for normal patients to improve endurance and stamina,

14
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,540
it is an excellent form of exercise.

15
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,340
That's why I'm giving that 7 out of 10.
